# A V.32 call to a far end that has no V.32, diagnosed tone by tone in
# docs/recordings/v32/README.md: answer tone, then V.22's unscrambled
# binary 1, then V.21's mark, and nowhere any energy at 600 and 3000 Hz.
#
# The fixture is here to pin the failure.  A modem that reports CONNECT
# on this recording is hallucinating a carrier, and one that hands bytes
# to the DTE is handing over its own descrambler running on noise -- the
# two false banners named in recordings/README.md were exactly that.
# Nothing, from a call that offered everything, is the right answer.
source:    docs/recordings/v32/live-bbs-heard.wav
seconds:   22
role:      originate
modes:     v32,v22bis,v22,v21
v8:        yes
connect:   none
tolerance: 0
